<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has expanded its footprint in southern Lebanon by constructing a 90km network of military roads, including one in the Shebaa Valley buffer zone, and establishing new bases. Hezbollah has continued artillery fire on Israeli positions and begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Israeli strikes have wounded a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65-year-old retired engineer. Protests against Israeli attacks on Palestine and Lebanon occurred in Sweden. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon, and there were 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQbDYtSkVDcUJnSjlicW95RzQ2c3RKb3JZSkVaaG1TMGtFbGRVZHVNdk1YS1RNMTR1aUExVHRXcGFaRG80YlhKenZsOXZGRHctMEU1SHlnckNDenB0cDdNZ1VoWWl2d0NjVWoxQU1Gc003QWttZG9XV19oc2VFOUFaZTZQcUx2NmloaU52OWUzeUxVVVRXZ2hpancxZW1JSnZRQXEzc1JZSndHMkRPeF92RGlHQzM0NDF3QlU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Antiwar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBWU09vMFFzYVd3eXBTSDd3N2ZJcl9oSmR0YTdHZVVZdXJrWlhiYTltRlFhRXUyYmJEVHBhd0tXMHdtMTN3ZGhjelpOZzR1c1VnekpnRmlIWVpjV1Uy?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9OUzdsRkt0dTVkRW5Zb1V2VDhKRlVQbWpveC1qVUFjRWZvOGZoMWVtWE5NcXRpOERXVzZIVHFRVHM1VGdQVTZHa2tXUUhSS0hFZExRZHNnSERkeHNoSExTc3F6M1ZBYlVSZEd0N2I5QVZMVlR0SlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Star Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNY